      "writtenOn": "2025-03-21T21:21:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that if the crash happened during Graphite initialization, the GPU process would restart. If it crashed 3 times, then the GPU process would fall back to Ganesh which won\u0027t use Dawn.\n\nThe behavior before those two changes was somewhat the same: We queried for `ID3D11Device5` and if it wasn\u0027t available on older devices, we then return Error to Chrome (instead of crashing), and chrome would fall back to Ganesh.",
      "parentUuid": "87142f0e_72e9792a",
      "revId": "d222a67b9a079f0c1e3d1caa511296cd77b462cb",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
